#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Cong kiem OpenSpec cho lan merge (chay trong worktree, vd: merge-lane.py <wt> --check "python .../openspec-gate.py").

OpenSpec 1.14.2 tu no KHONG chan task chua xong: `openspec archive --yes` chay ca khi 0/6 task.
Cong nay chan 3 truong hop:
